# Ultra Bee AI chat assistant (server-side only).
# Dedicated OpenRouter key for Ultra Bee - completely separate from the
# verification system's OPENROUTER_API_KEY / OPENROUTER_API_KEY2..4 (do not
# reuse the verification key here, and verification never reads this one).
